{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>29歲「講波女神」鄭杞瑤Kylie C.日前飛往越南旅行，罕有在社交平台瘋狂洗版曬出突破尺度惹火泳裝照，瞬間引 …</p><p></p>\n<p>29歲「講波女神」鄭杞瑤Kylie C.日前飛往越南旅行，罕有在社交平台瘋狂洗版曬出突破尺度惹火泳裝照，瞬間引爆網絡熱話。這批震驚網民眼球極限相片不僅展現極致視覺效果，背後更隱藏一段不為人知辛酸經歷。\n</p>\n<h2>鄭杞瑤著藍白條紋三點式大派福利</h2>\n<p>鄭杞瑤抵達越南後連環發功，繼早前身穿性感晚裝品嚐當地美食後，日前再度在Instagram上載多張身處海灘震撼靚相。相中她換上一套藍白條紋三點式比堅尼，搭配黑色太陽眼鏡，在黃昏海景襯托下大擺誘人姿勢。由於泳衣布料極度單薄加上超高衩設計，豐滿上圍完全呈現包不住狀態。另外她更刻意採用由上而下邪惡俯瞰視角自拍，惹火指數直接衝破頂點，為粉絲帶來超強烈視覺衝擊。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316409587987926_17465078406ae1834081c0e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ckykylie_1792936988_4015767262419387811_20002748.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316409587987926_17465078406ae1834081c0e.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316409819033343_5828504676ae183428404f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ckykylie_1792936988_4015767267167294058_20002748.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316409819033343_5828504676ae183428404f.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316410017845192_19308025986ae1834497f00.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ckykylie_1792936988_4015767265858812695_20002748.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316410017845192_19308025986ae1834497f00.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>Kylie自信反擊外間對身材種種批評</h2>\n<p>面對外界長期將焦點放在其傲人身段，鄭杞瑤今次不僅大方展示身段，更在貼文寫下「my life, my rules, my attitude.」以及「we will never be at this age again, do whatever makes you happy.」表明心跡。她強烈表達對個人生活態度堅持，直指不會再回到現在這個年紀，誓言要做任何能讓自己快樂事情。這種霸氣宣言徹底展現出她對個人身體自主權掌握，無視外界過度審視目光。</p>\n<h2>講波女神曾因暴腫受盡輿論沉重壓力</h2>\n<p>其實這位從網紅轉型足球節目主持兼歌手向來備受壓力，早前接受外籍YouTuber街訪時，就曾用流利英語大爆香港人過度關注女性身體。她透露數年前剛入行時曾經病過及暴腫，當時大眾對她衣著品味以至暴露程度指指點點，令她深受傷害。經過長時間內心掙扎，她表示已經看透這一切，強調現時只追求自己開心舒服穿衣風格，絕對不需要再顧慮其他人閒言閒語。\n</p>\n<h2>Kylie C望大家留意內涵 網民不睇好</h2>\n<p>Kylie C.一向以驕人身材和性感形象聞名，長期以來是社交平台焦點。Kylie C.曾經有一段時間清空IG上所有性感照片，儘保留幾張密實打扮嘅照片，轉做歌手後收起性感，坦言希望大家留意其內涵。網民不睇好表示：「同叫人唔好留意美斯球技有咩分別」、「隱藏自己嘅優點 突出自己嘅缺點」。</p>\n<h2>網民群情洶湧湧入Kylie社交平台狂讚</h2>\n<p>震撼福利照一出，大批網民隨即陷入瘋狂狀態，紛紛湧入留言區洗版式狂讚。不少忠實粉絲忍不住直呼「太正！！犯規！！！」以及「好靚女❤️好身材🔥」，激動表達對偶像支持。部分網民更形容今次畫面是「魔體再現」，大讚其身段「個shape好挺」，甚至有人誇張留言表示「呢鑊唔俾❤️❤️都唔得」。各界極端熱烈反應令該則貼文熱度持續飆升，成為近期最具話題性網絡事件。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316410228228923_9631078706ae18346a4c87.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ckykylie_1792584869_4012813485745019786_20002748 (1).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316410228228923_9631078706ae18346a4c87.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316410576132564_5264646766ae1834a2ab91.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ckykylie_1792936988_4015767257595855132_20002748.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316410576132564_5264646766ae1834a2ab91.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%af%94%e5%a0%85%e5%b0%bc/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">比堅尼</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%b6%b2%e7%b4%85/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">網紅</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%84%ad%e6%9d%9e%e7%91%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭杞瑤</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3531527\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 28 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:21:19.467821+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1526,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:08:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:18:51.873716+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T06:18:37.975490+00:00","content_hash":"0a4e7deee0f5b472858f253b9c69c729c5d997a3a493a50a0f61e2b5b2487a3e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}